WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.007 --> 00:00:26.815
Tom liked to go to the farm.

2
00:00:26.816 --> 00:00:34.573
Every morning the farmer's wife milked the cows.

3
00:00:34.574 --> 00:00:38.179
She always gave Tom some milk.

4
00:00:38.180 --> 00:00:53.687
Mmm!

5
00:00:53.688 --> 00:01:04.748
One morning Tom wanted more milk.

6
00:01:04.749 --> 00:01:08.709
So he ran to the lamb pen.

7
00:01:08.710 --> 00:01:13.741
Tom hid under some wool.

8
00:01:13.742 --> 00:01:18.118
Soon the farmer's wife came.

9
00:01:18.119 --> 00:01:31.895
She gave the lambs their bottles.

10
00:01:31.896 --> 00:01:35.490
The farmer's wife spotted Tom.

11
00:01:35.491 --> 00:01:38.923
"Silly kitten!" she said.

12
00:01:38.924 --> 00:01:51.069
"You had some milk already!"

13
00:01:51.070 --> 00:01:54.407
Next the farmer's wife went to the goats.

14
00:01:54.408 --> 00:02:00.242
She brought some milk bottles.

15
00:02:00.243 --> 00:02:04.994
Tom ran after her.

16
00:02:04.995 --> 00:02:08.499
Tom tried to get a bottle first.

17
00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:11.106
"Neigh!" said the goats.

18
00:02:11.107 --> 00:02:14.922
"Go away, Tom!"

19
00:02:14.923 --> 00:02:18.679
The farmer's wife saw Tom.

20
00:02:18.680 --> 00:02:27.580
"Naughty kitten!" she said. "Shoo!"

21
00:02:27.581 --> 00:02:38.279
The farmer's wife gave Kep some milk.

22
00:02:38.280 --> 00:02:49.658
Tom ran toward Kep.

23
00:02:49.659 --> 00:02:51.627
But Kep growled.

24
00:02:51.628 --> 00:02:57.912
"Stay away, Tom!" he said.
